alpine-anchor.min.js is @alpinejs/anchor 3.17.4 and alpine-focus.min.js is @alpinejs/focus 3.17.4,
the CDN builds from npm. anchor bundles @floating-ui/dom; focus bundles focus-trap and tabbable.

